Author: Nick Hung <nick@andestech.com>
Date:   Sat Jun 27 22:28:36 2026 +0800

    Andes V5 CSR transport: drain + verify (v3 ABI)

    Behavioral. QEMU plugin drains the Andes CSR block via the shared HYBRID_ANDES_CSR_LIST X-macro and sets HYBRID_FLAG_ANDES when the gdbstub advertised at least one Andes CSR. Driver --verify compares the block, excluding msp_bound/msp_base (engine-reset-divergent, like mip). Bumps the include/ ABI submodule to the v3 commit. Adds docs/andes_csr_transport_ROADMAP.md and updates CLAUDE.md.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

